    /// [`AV_SCREEN_CAPTURE_ERR_INVALID_VAL`](crate::avscreen_capture_errors::OH_AVSCREEN_CAPTURE_ErrCode::AV_SCREEN_CAPTURE_ERR_INVALID_VAL): The input parameter **strategy** is nullptr.
